      "id": 2,
      "title": "",
      "type": "text",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Temporal Task Queue Partitions** \u2014 single-queue view for changing partition counts. Use with the **[playbook](https://github.com/tsurdilo/temporal-metrics/blob/main/playbooks/change-task-queue-partitions.md)** (how to decide & act) and the **[dashboard reference](https://github.com/tsurdilo/temporal-metrics/blob/main/metrics/dashboards/server/task-queue-partitions-readme.md)** (what each panel means).\n\n_Panels empty?_ `metrics.breakdownByPartition` + `metrics.breakdownByTaskQueue` must be on for this queue."
      }
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Per-Partition Backlog \u2014 Drain & Write>Read Detection",
      "type": "row",
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Approximate Backlog Count by Partition",
      "description": "",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "min",
            "max",
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (partition) (approximate_backlog_count{namespace=\"$namespace\", taskqueue=\"$taskqueue\", task_type=\"$task_type\", service_name=~\"matching\"})",
          "legendFormat": "partition {{partition}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
